    "abstract": {
      "en": "Global 30 m forest canopy height for 2019, subsampled to the Caucasus ecoregion. The product integrates GEDI lidar forest-structure measurements with Landsat analysis-ready time series. Pixel values 0–60 represent canopy height in metres; 101 = water; 102 = snow/ice; 103 = no data.",
